1
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:28,260
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:31,500
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,100
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,700
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,060
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:43,100
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,060
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:49,420
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:03,620
(Duan Xiuming wants to add you;
Ignore/Accept)

10
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,720
(Duan Xiuming: Are you okay?)

11
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:10,640
(Lu Mingyu: I'm fine.)

12
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,280
(Lu Mingyu: Thanks.)

13
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:14,960
(Duan Xiuming:
Did your cousin bully you?)

14
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:18,040
(Lu Mingyu: Maybe I'm the bully.)

15
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,040
(Duan Xiuming: So, what's my reward?)

16
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,600
(Lu Mingyu: Are you a kid?)

17
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,680
(Lu Mingyu: Fine, say it.)

18
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,240
(Duan Xiuming: Come out tomorrow.)

19
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,680
(Duan Xiuming: I'll take you
for Cantonese food.)

20
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,400
(Lu Mingyu: Not tomorrow.)

21
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,080
(Lu Mingyu: After all that drama today,)

22
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,680
(Lu Mingyu: I need to behave.)

23
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,160
(Duan Xiuming: Quite a good girl.)

24
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:46,920
(Duan Xiuming: Get some sleep.)

25
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,160
(Duan Xiuming: Good night.)

26
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:49,840
(Lu Mingyu: Good night.)

27
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:53,910
=Quite The Girl=

28
00:01:53,910 --> 00:01:54,610
(Adapted from the Tomato Novel
"Quite the Girl.")

29
00:01:54,610 --> 00:01:55,300
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

30
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:56,820
=Episode 4=

31
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:03,840
Lu Mingyu!

32
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,280
Explain yourself!

33
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,720
What's with the footage?

34
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,440
You got beaten yesterday.

35
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,880
Healed up that fast?

36
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,120
You dare talk back?

37
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,360
I'll beat you to death!

38
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,160
(Royal Imperial Academy of Arts)
What's all this?

39
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:30,080
When Dad gets back,

40
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,880
I'll tell him everything.

41
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,240
That beating yesterday...

42
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,280
I'll make you pay double.

43
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:36,360
Come on.

44
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,320
You useless idiot.

45
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,040
Just you wait!

46
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,720
(No.)

47
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,600
(I can't let Uncle believe
what Lu Qian says.)

48
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,760
(Or my plan to go abroad
will be exposed.)

49
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:00,360
Yue.

50
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:02,320
Keep an eye on Lu Qian.

51
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:04,200
Tell me if you hear anything.

52
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,480
(Okay.)

53
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,320
Ming.

54
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:17,400
What's the plan today?

55
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,080
You've been running around

56
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,200
with Auntie Chen's stuff.

57
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,040
I appreciate it.

58
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,040
I'll treat you to a nice meal.

59
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:22,880
Really?

60
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:23,960
Great.

61
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,440
I'm in for a treat.

62
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:27,040
I was gonna bring Lu Mingyu,

63
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:27,960
but she's busy.

64
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:28,800
Lucky you.

65
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,280
Xiuming.

66
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,320
Actually, you know what?

67
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,280
I haven't been that busy.

68
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,080
We can skip the meal.

69
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,720
Who are you fooling?

70
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:40,000
You never miss a free meal.

71
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,240
No visible chin.

72
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,120
Stop pretending.

73
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,200
Xiuming.

74
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,520
Just one thing.

75
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:46,560
I'll take the meal,

76
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:47,680
but don't get mad.

77
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,840
I'm here to eat.

78
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:52,840
Why would I get mad?

79
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,960
Xiuming, you go ahead.

80
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:58,760
I'm out.

81
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,600
How's the food?

82
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,240
Not bad.

83
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:31,680
Phone.

84
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,480
Your birthday's the passcode.

85
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,400
Call yourself if needed.

86
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,360
I'll wait outside.

87
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,800
Lunch is on me, too.

88
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,680
Same passcode.

89
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:54,640
Mingyu.

90
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,760
Is he your boyfriend?

91
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,200
Not yet.

92
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,000
Not yet, huh?

93
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,560
Mingyu.

94
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:04,880
How long have you known each other?

95
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,520
A month.

96
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,760
Just a month?

97
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,640
It's a short time.

98
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,880
You should've seen the look on his face.

99
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,520
Like he was gonna eat someone alive.

100
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:18,640
Think he might be violent?

101
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:21,600
I don't know about him,

102
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:22,480
but you...

103
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:23,640
You're overstepping.

104
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,000
I'm done, bye.

105
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,400
See you.

106
00:05:30,060 --> 00:05:32,220
(Luback)

107
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:40,160
Such good food.

108
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,280
Done already?

109
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,800
They're just my high school friends.

110
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,640
So you chose old friends

111
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,960
instead of me?

112
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,800
Duan Xiuming.

113
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:54,400
About today,

114
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,680
it was just a coincidence.

115
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,200
We didn't plan it.

116
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,280
And I had no idea

117
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,720
the restaurant I went to

118
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,560
was the one you mentioned.

119
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,520
I didn't mean to...

120
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:04,240
Okay, I believe you.

121
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:07,040
Her name is Xiang Yi.

122
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,960
She's a doctor.

123
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,200
My arm hurt, so I went...

124
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,400
Your arm was hurt?

125
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:12,480
Why didn't you tell me?

126
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,480
What's wrong?

127
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:24,840
Nothing.

128
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:26,920
I thought...

129
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:27,880
Thought what?

130
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,760
Thought you'd hit me.

131
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,080
Does your family hit you often?

132
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,080
How'd you know?

133
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:48,080
You flinched just now.

134
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,080
Punishment...

135
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,440
It's normal.

136
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:55,920
At your age,

137
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,760
I don't think it's normal.

138
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,680
Have you ever been hit?

139
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:01,880
No.

140
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,160
At least not from family.

141
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,480
A happy family...

142
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,320
Must be nice.

143
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,560
How could they hit that pretty face?

144
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,440
How long has it been?

145
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,400
Ten years.

146
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,680
Marry me.

147
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,720
No hitting in my family.

148
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,560
No one touches my woman.

149
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:32,600
Not even me.

150
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,320
So?

151
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,080
Then...

152
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:38,840
Come propose.

153
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,440
Okay.

154
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:41,960
Wait for me.

155
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,120
I'll be quick.

156
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,280
Okay.

157
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:53,080
We're dating now. You know that?

158
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,120
As your boyfriend,

159
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,760
can I ask for something?

160
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,640
What do you want?

161
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,400
Like,

162
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:02,920
kissing...

163
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,320
Hugging...

164
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,360
And...

165
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:08,480
I thought you'd say...

166
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:11,400
No eating alone with guys.

167
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,400
I'd love to.

168
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:15,520
But with your rebellious streak...

169
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,160
Can I?

170
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:18,200
Eating alone with a guy?

171
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:22,600
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

172
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,800
Can you just behave?

173
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,440
I'm not mad today,

174
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,840
but I might be next time.

175
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:31,680
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

176
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,640
(Xu Suyue: Lu Qian's heading here.)

177
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,440
My boyfriend.

178
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:39,000
Take me somewhere.

179
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:40,720
Let's go.

180
00:08:41,940 --> 00:08:43,500
(Luback)

181
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:48,560
(XiA 89988)

182
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,640
Here we are.

183
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:51,800
So...

184
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,960
What's the plan?

185
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:53,960
Lu Qian's inside.

186
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,680
Can you soak her phone?

187
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:56,760
Two minutes.

188
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:00,560
Done.

189
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,560
Kiss me.

190
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,760
Move. Let her see.

191
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:24,580
♪Quiet breath hides my sharp mind♪

192
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:26,560
Lu Mingyu!

193
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:30,300
♪Save my strength to turn the tide♪

194
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:31,240
Evidence...

195
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,200
The evidence...

196
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:34,800
You're done.

197
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:39,140
♪You never know my world♪

198
00:09:39,260 --> 00:09:41,300
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

199
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:44,220
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

200
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:45,520
Right here!

201
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:46,800
Lu Mingyu with some guy,

202
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:47,720
hooking up in a car.

203
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:50,460
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

204
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:52,560
What?

205
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:53,640
Wanna fight?

206
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,200
Qian...

207
00:09:58,880 --> 00:09:59,480
What's wrong?

208
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:16,880
Right here...

209
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,240
Lu Mingyu with some guy,

210
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,040
hooking up in a car.

211
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,920
Did you hire that guy?

212
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:25,200
You two were really going at it.

213
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,640
I even saw him move.

214
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:28,520
Did you two actually do it?

215
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,160
The guy is real.

216
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,080
Not an actor.

217
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,840
But that move was fake.

218
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:36,520
What do you mean?

219
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:37,640
My boyfriend.

220
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:38,680
Acting.

221
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,120
Oh my...

222
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,800
When did you get a boyfriend?

223
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,200
Oh my goodness.

224
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:46,960
Being your friend is exhausting.

225
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,440
Dad.

226
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:53,080
I saw it with my own eyes.

227
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:54,880
Lu Mingyu was in a car with a guy,

228
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,520
right outside the restaurant.

229
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,880
Shameless.

230
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:59,440
Utterly disgraceful.

231
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,520
Mingyu.

232
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,240
Is she telling the truth?

233
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:04,640
Uncle.

234
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,440
I did go to the restaurant.

235
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:09,760
But I was with Xu Suyue.

236
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:12,400
I told you this morning.

237
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,040
You're lying again.

238
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:16,360
Too bad my phone broke.

239
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,000
Right outside the restaurant,

240
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:19,720
in a black car.

241
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:21,520
You and that guy were kissing.

242
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:22,320
And you even...

243
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,320
I can't even say it!

244
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:25,320
Uncle.

245
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,720
She called everyone

246
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,120
to the restaurant entrance.

247
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:30,480
Mr. Wang's daughter was there, too.

248
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,600
You can call her.

249
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,560
Ask if I was with her.

250
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,720
Lu Mingyu...

251
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:36,920
Sis...

252
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,000
Last time at the lounge,

253
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,440
you accused me of hooking up.

254
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:40,960
And now again.

255
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:43,000
What did I ever do to you?

256
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:45,360
You're such a fake.

257
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,160
Dad.

258
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,000
This morning, I saw her

259
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,200
in her room,

260
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,720
sneaking around online.

261
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:53,120
When I came over,
she grabbed her laptop.

262
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,800
She's hiding something.

263
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,760
Qian...

264
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:56,760
I know

265
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,440
since I got here,

266
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:00,120
you've always hated me.

267
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:02,200
But you can't keep making things up.

268
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,680
You came into my room this morning

269
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:06,520
and threw things at me for no reason.

270
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:08,640
Lu Mingyu.

271
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:11,240
You witch, I'll kill you!

272
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:11,920
Stop!

273
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,480
Dad, I...

274
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:23,800
Dad...

275
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:25,280
Dad...

276
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:28,320
♪My own salvation I believe♪

277
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:28,960
Dad...

278
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,840
You're grounded.

279
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:34,000
Not a step outside without my say.

280
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:35,160
Dad...

281
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,040
Are you okay?

282
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,280
Never better.

283
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:46,040
My cousin's grounded.

284
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:48,160
She's losing her mind.

285
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:49,520
How'd I do today?

286
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,720
Was I good?

287
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,080
What?

288
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:53,280
Didn't you feel it?

289
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,000
You tease and run.

290
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:59,320
It's been hours.

291
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,200
I'll come get you now.

292
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,480
Are you crazy?

293
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,800
You started it.

294
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:05,040
What was that about?

295
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:07,360
Are you leaving me hanging?

296
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:09,000
How am I supposed to sleep?

297
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,960
Use some self-control.

298
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:13,240
I have a girlfriend now.
Why would I need that?

299
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:16,800
Still laughing?

300
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,320
Duan Xiuming.

301
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,480
Your efficiency...

302
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,360
is unmatched.

303
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:26,000
No questions asked.

304
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:27,240
Clean...

305
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,200
And sharp.

306
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:29,600
That's nothing.

307
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,120
Get some sleep.

308
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,360
Don't forget to put medicine
on your arm.

309
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:34,040
I'll teach you to fight.

310
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:35,440
Good night.

311
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:38,830
♪Passing by under green lights♪

312
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:46,320
♪In the airport corner, bags between us♪

313
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,720
Take me somewhere.

314
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:49,320
Kiss me.

315
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:50,920
Let her see.

316
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,320
Setting up all day,

317
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,160
you do know how to use connections.

318
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,000
But what you didn't expect

319
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:06,000
is that I really want to marry you.

320
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,520
(I've searched so long.)

321
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:32,520
(Where did Auntie hide the key?)

322
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:34,200
Lu Mingyu is a witch.

323
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,600
Ever since she got here,

324
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:36,880
there's been no peace.

325
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,480
You've suffered enough.

326
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:39,920
I'll find a way

327
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:41,800
to make her pay.

328
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,280
Auntie.

329
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:51,120
You really are vicious.

330
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:53,680
A few words and the whole house erupts.

331
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:55,440
Look at Lu Qian now.

332
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:56,960
You must be thrilled.

333
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,320
Time for fireworks.

334
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,320
You...

335
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:01,080
You...

336
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,720
You witch.

337
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:04,440
She wasn't lying, was she?

338
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:06,640
You're a curse on us.

339
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:08,080
And your mother, that witch.

340
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,440
Ten years apart because of her...

341
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:10,160
Auntie.

342
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:14,880
My mom never showed Uncle any interest,

343
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:16,480
not even a glance.

344
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:19,120
Get a grip, you two.

345
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:22,400
Your uncle's not home today.

346
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:24,360
I've wanted to slap you.

347
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:29,840
Auntie.

348
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,960
Are you sure you want to leave a mark

349
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:33,040
on this face?

350
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:41,280
Ma'am.

351
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:43,320
The old lady's meal is ready.

352
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:44,720
I'll take it to her now.

353
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,080
Wait.

354
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,000
Oh, no.

355
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:59,800
No dinner for Grandma.

356
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,280
How's that?

357
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,600
Worried now?

358
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,280
Don't forget,

359
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:07,160
I'm the one who feeds Grandma.

360
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:10,280
Keep acting up,

361
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,200
and I'll dig up your mom's grave.

362
00:16:25,880 --> 00:16:27,640
(I need to find the key,)

363
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:28,920
(get my passport back,)

364
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,880
(and get Grandma out of here soon.)

365
00:17:03,030 --> 00:17:08,180
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

366
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:14,200
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

367
00:17:17,100 --> 00:17:21,880
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

368
00:17:22,820 --> 00:17:28,700
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

369
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:36,330
♪A love letter written in song♪

370
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:42,650
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

371
00:17:44,490 --> 00:17:50,800
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

372
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:57,700
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

373
00:17:57,700 --> 00:18:01,100
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

374
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:04,820
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

375
00:18:05,450 --> 00:18:07,910
♪Close your eyes and count♪

376
00:18:07,910 --> 00:18:14,620
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

377
00:18:14,620 --> 00:18:16,920
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
